Engineering Design Goals

The architecture was designed to:

reduce manual debugging effort,

automate deployment remediation,

improve operational efficiency,

and demonstrate AI-native DevOps workflows.


The system emphasizes:

modular architecture,

production-oriented design,

autonomous remediation,

and structured engineering outputs.